 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Icarus Dive icon0}}
| desc = Phoenix dives forward in an arc with a fixed distance in the targeted direction, dealing damage over time and slowing the movement speed of any units it comes into contact with, and then orbiting back to its original position. If Phoenix casts Supernova, the dive ends.
}}
* The dive speed is not constant.
** Phoenix starts at 0-speed, accelerates until halfway through the max distance, then slows down toward the max distance, the same applies while traveling on the way back.
** Dives at an average {{calc|v1/{{#var:Icarus Dive value4}} round2|v1={{#var:P}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1/{{#var:Icarus Dive value4}} round2|v1={{#var:P tal}}}}|25tal}})-speed.

* Can deal up {{calc|v1*{{#var:Icarus Dive basic1}}*({{#var:Icarus Dive type1 value3}}/{{#var:Icarus Dive basic1}}-1)|v1={{#var:Icarus Dive type1 value1}}}} damage ([[before reductions]]) to a single enemy unit, over {{#expr:{{#var:Icarus Dive type1 value3}}/{{#var:Icarus Dive basic1}}-1}} damage instances.

