{{Morphnotes
| name = Fire Spirit
| desc = Existing {{A|Phoenix|Fire Spirits}} immediately disappear upon losing ability.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Fire Spirit
| desc = Existing {{A|Phoenix|Fire Spirits}} immediately disappear upon losing ability.
}}

 * {{Symbol|a|sub}}
** Replaces {{A|Phoenix|Fire Spirits}} until all charges are used.
** Can be launched in any direction without {{M|Turn Rate|text=turning}} while the following abilities are active:
*** {{A|Phoenix|Icarus Dive}}
*** {{A|Phoenix|Sun Ray}}

* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has a {{#var:Launch Fire Spirit basic2}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Vision|Base}}
*** Each [[projectile]] launched grants a 1-second {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#var:Launch Fire Spirit value1}}-radius [[vision]] at the {{Symbol|Target|Area}} area-targeted location.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes the duration.
** Deals {{calc|v1*{{#var:Launch Fire Spirit basic1}}|v1={{#var:Launch Fire Spirit value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2r}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Launch Fire Spirit basic1}}|v1={{#var:Launch Fire Spirit value2 tal}}}}|15tal}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in {{#var:Launch Fire Spirit basic1}}-second intervals per fire spirit, starting {{#var:Launch Fire Spirit basic1}} seconds after the {{M|debuff}} is applied, ending {{#var:Launch Fire Spirit basic1}} seconds after the last damage instance.
** The total damage is defined as:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Total[[Spell Damage|SpellDmg]] {{=}} (Duration / {{#var:Launch Fire Spirit basic1}} - 1) × (DPS × {{#var:Launch Fire Spirit basic1}})}}

* Leveling up the ability does not immediately update the current instance.
** {{cf|talnotes}} However, the {{ValueColor||damage increasing|15tal}} {{M|talent|t=t2r}} immediately update the current instance.

