fields.value:

{{Stealnotes
| name = Supernova
| desc = Does not {{M|instant kill}} the {{U|Phoenix Sun}} upon losing the ability.<br><br>{{H|Rubick}} is able to cast the lastest acquired ability if the {{A|Rubick|Spell Steal}} {{M|projectile}} reaches him while already within the Phoenix Sun.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Supernova icon0}}
| desc = The Phoenix willingly ends its current life for the chance to be reborn. Transforms into a burning sun that scorches enemies in a huge area. The sun can be destroyed by attacks from enemy Heroes. After 6 seconds the sun explodes, stunning all nearby enemies while restoring Phoenix to full health and mana with refreshed abilities.
}}
{{Killcard}}

* Deals {{calc|(v1*{{#var:Supernova basic1}})*(ceil(({{#var:Supernova value4}}+{{#var:Supernova value5}})/{{#var:Supernova basic1}})-1)|v1={{#var:Supernova value3}}}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) within the radius for the entire duration, over {{#expr:ceil(({{#var:Supernova value4}}+{{#var:Supernova value5}})/{{#var:Supernova basic1}})-1}} possible instances.

* {{cf|aghnotes}} Has the following ability interactions with {{M|reincarnation}} sources:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Reincarnation sources on Phoenix releases the affected ally as-is without any ability effects applied.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** Reincarnation sources on the affected ally reincarnates the ally while Phoenix dies. 

* {{cf|shdnotes}} Supernova cast during {{A|Phoenix|Sun Ray}} resets Sun Ray's {{M|cooldown}} once Supernova ends.
** If Supernova ends during Sun Ray, Sun Ray continues normally, with its {{M|sub-ability|text=sub-abilities}} becoming active again.

